{"1979290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "魔女旅店 Witches Tavern", "steam_appid": 1979290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious witch rescued you from a coma in the Demon Forest, only to teach you how to run a tavern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to teleport you and the tavern to a strange town, she was willing to let herself vanish into thin air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the Tranquilizing Honey Wine, which can free witches from their nightmares, your tavern quickly becomes bustling with business. So you start recruiting staff, decorating the tavern, purchasing ingredients, developing dishes, making friends... and exploring this fun-filled world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But please don't forget to find the answer: who is the witch who saved you? What exactly happened before you fell into a coma?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/974acce7abe501a4a851b2e5c1967b5d.avif?t=1782279052\" width=700 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/5c6c207c5dd31125d34d1075f40b5401.poster.avif?t=1782279052\" width=850 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/5c6c207c5dd31125d34d1075f40b5401.webm?t=1782279052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/5c6c207c5dd31125d34d1075f40b5401.mp4?t=1782279052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use diverse cooking techniques to craft all kinds of delicacies. With recipes collected from around the world, you have the freedom to customize your menu exactly as you wish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/c7b3ccd616520972606869675db8a44a.avif?t=1782279052\" width=700 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/2188a023fa0b246bf881a35a732debef.poster.avif?t=1782279052\" width=850 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/2188a023fa0b246bf881a35a732debef.webm?t=1782279052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/2188a023fa0b246bf881a35a732debef.mp4?t=1782279052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically decorate your tavern to maximize profits. It's time to unleash your management talents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/fc2b942a49c91c8e1a09d923c2df5ddb.avif?t=1782279052\" width=700 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/aee1276465286c6e5379a49bfc725258.poster.avif?t=1782279052\" width=850 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/aee1276465286c6e5379a49bfc725258.webm?t=1782279052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/aee1276465286c6e5379a49bfc725258.mp4?t=1782279052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your fame grows, you must cater to the diverse demands of a surging crowd. When things get hectic, call upon a friend—or a familiar—to lend a hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/794872667cbf3eca51d2d2b41025fb74.avif?t=1782279052\" width=700 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/08afffc8fbbac9a933f2bc7b272b7f71.poster.avif?t=1782279052\" width=850 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/08afffc8fbbac9a933f2bc7b272b7f71.webm?t=1782279052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/08afffc8fbbac9a933f2bc7b272b7f71.mp4?t=1782279052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revitalize a vast stretch of untamed land boasting the most fertile soil by the lagoon. What crops will you grow to enrich your tavern's menu?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/2eb03ee0446932c71dc9673a95897af4.avif?t=1782279052\" width=700 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/9d59b6dae9fe1adb9ff47c5cca6ad298.poster.avif?t=1782279052\" width=850 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/9d59b6dae9fe1adb9ff47c5cca6ad298.webm?t=1782279052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/9d59b6dae9fe1adb9ff47c5cca6ad298.mp4?t=1782279052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from over 30 sets of outfits and hairstyles. Mix and match freely to create your perfect look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/ba027b08a4382b43e4fe6c5820d48ad5.avif?t=1782279052\" width=700 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/15419b85ab3f28f00212f4a8b10892a1.poster.avif?t=1782279052\" width=850 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/15419b85ab3f28f00212f4a8b10892a1.webm?t=1782279052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/15419b85ab3f28f00212f4a8b10892a1.mp4?t=1782279052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a vow with your beloved amidst the blessings of all the townspeople!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/ac2e2e7a04b006b15f617c28d7b675e6.avif?t=1782279052\" width=700 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/2c6db76c59810f0eb344dbe83adca62c.avif?t=1782279052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras_big/2c6db76c59810f0eb344dbe83adca62c.webp?t=1782279052 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/de675a6b15402815d40899314875eb2f.avif?t=1782279052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras_big/de675a6b15402815d40899314875eb2f.webp?t=1782279052 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/df92538eb3967f388d6c9e8508105597.avif?t=1782279052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras_big/df92538eb3967f388d6c9e8508105597.webp?t=1782279052 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/aff960034dff1b7e25a1f29461d2bc71.avif?t=1782279052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras_big/aff960034dff1b7e25a1f29461d2bc71.webp?t=1782279052 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/a0333b9357095cfad9d7064ccdcaa700.avif?t=1782279052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras_big/a0333b9357095cfad9d7064ccdcaa700.webp?t=1782279052 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/7489a2f28c365a3b9c7fbd50baa8511f.avif?t=1782279052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras_big/7489a2f28c365a3b9c7fbd50baa8511f.webp?t=1782279052 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/88c3055d85e7e886a37c1323bd17a87a.avif?t=1782279052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras_big/88c3055d85e7e886a37c1323bd17a87a.webp?t=1782279052 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/091e60bd1d119cddeb3f2ba0e7b31eec.avif?t=1782279052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras_big/091e60bd1d119cddeb3f2ba0e7b31eec.webp?t=1782279052 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/2ecbc784afdad570cc82826377b83217.avif?t=1782279052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras_big/2ecbc784afdad570cc82826377b83217.webp?t=1782279052 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/cdc52392ccf724cac1f30990a8d679a7.avif?t=1782279052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras_big/cdc52392ccf724cac1f30990a8d679a7.webp?t=1782279052 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/f48c5d9df3c3223ed040abc62cc4fda1.avif?t=1782279052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras_big/f48c5d9df3c3223ed040abc62cc4fda1.webp?t=1782279052 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/928ffad3a6918f165800ebf7566f1bfa.avif?t=1782279052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras_big/928ffad3a6918f165800ebf7566f1bfa.webp?t=1782279052 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/c585f57d0acbf031cd174e78bcb9b26f.avif?t=1782279052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras_big/c585f57d0acbf031cd174e78bcb9b26f.webp?t=1782279052 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/bd7015212f67e462bf274253efd8925a.avif?t=1782279052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras_big/bd7015212f67e462bf274253efd8925a.webp?t=1782279052 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/24613273bdd6150e81d7d768aef37780.avif?t=1782279052\" width=700 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Encountering vivid characters——</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of bonds will arise from meeting them? What kind of stories can we write together with them? What changes will your arrival bring to them? This will depend on your actions and choices!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Taste seeking Magic Continent——</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Padua and the royal city of Anglin face each other from afar across the Sea of Mirrors. People from all over the world come here every day, how can we satisfy the tastes of different customers? What strange dishes can be cooked using a variety of strange ingredients for harvesting?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Choose a leisurely lifestyle——</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to spend time outside of opening a store? Whether it's feeling the joy of harvesting fruits or experiencing the joy of catching a big fish; Whether it's brewing delicious wine or embarking on adventures and adventures Choose the way you like and enjoy life freely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Enhance partner goodwill——</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stable operation of the Witch's Tavern relies on the support and assistance of friends. Through interaction and communication, sincere emotions are born. However, can our relationship be closer? Friendship? love? Make a choice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Take a walk outside when you have free time——</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Staying in the store all day is too boring! Going out may encounter strange events and unexpected gains: travelers carrying pig tails, graves washed away by floods, basements as bright as daylight... Maybe you will also see a little-known side of your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Decorate personalized taverns——</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am in charge of my tavern! Is it warm or mischievous? Is it simple or gorgeous? Transform it as you please!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious witch rescued you from a coma in the Demon Forest, only to teach you how to run a tavern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to teleport you and the tavern to a strange town, she was willing to let herself vanish into thin air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the Tranquilizing Honey Wine, which can free witches from their nightmares, your tavern quickly becomes bustling with business. So you start recruiting staff, decorating the tavern, purchasing ingredients, developing dishes, making friends... and exploring this fun-filled world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But please don't forget to find the answer: who is the witch who saved you? What exactly happened before you fell into a coma?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/974acce7abe501a4a851b2e5c1967b5d.avif?t=1782279052\" width=700 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/5c6c207c5dd31125d34d1075f40b5401.poster.avif?t=1782279052\" width=850 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/5c6c207c5dd31125d34d1075f40b5401.webm?t=1782279052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/5c6c207c5dd31125d34d1075f40b5401.mp4?t=1782279052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use diverse cooking techniques to craft all kinds of delicacies. With recipes collected from around the world, you have the freedom to customize your menu exactly as you wish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/c7b3ccd616520972606869675db8a44a.avif?t=1782279052\" width=700 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/2188a023fa0b246bf881a35a732debef.poster.avif?t=1782279052\" width=850 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/2188a023fa0b246bf881a35a732debef.webm?t=1782279052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/2188a023fa0b246bf881a35a732debef.mp4?t=1782279052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically decorate your tavern to maximize profits. It's time to unleash your management talents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/fc2b942a49c91c8e1a09d923c2df5ddb.avif?t=1782279052\" width=700 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/aee1276465286c6e5379a49bfc725258.poster.avif?t=1782279052\" width=850 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/aee1276465286c6e5379a49bfc725258.webm?t=1782279052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/aee1276465286c6e5379a49bfc725258.mp4?t=1782279052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your fame grows, you must cater to the diverse demands of a surging crowd. When things get hectic, call upon a friend—or a familiar—to lend a hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/794872667cbf3eca51d2d2b41025fb74.avif?t=1782279052\" width=700 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/08afffc8fbbac9a933f2bc7b272b7f71.poster.avif?t=1782279052\" width=850 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/08afffc8fbbac9a933f2bc7b272b7f71.webm?t=1782279052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/08afffc8fbbac9a933f2bc7b272b7f71.mp4?t=1782279052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revitalize a vast stretch of untamed land boasting the most fertile soil by the lagoon. What crops will you grow to enrich your tavern's menu?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/2eb03ee0446932c71dc9673a95897af4.avif?t=1782279052\" width=700 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/9d59b6dae9fe1adb9ff47c5cca6ad298.poster.avif?t=1782279052\" width=850 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/9d59b6dae9fe1adb9ff47c5cca6ad298.webm?t=1782279052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/9d59b6dae9fe1adb9ff47c5cca6ad298.mp4?t=1782279052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from over 30 sets of outfits and hairstyles. Mix and match freely to create your perfect look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/ba027b08a4382b43e4fe6c5820d48ad5.avif?t=1782279052\" width=700 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/15419b85ab3f28f00212f4a8b10892a1.poster.avif?t=1782279052\" width=850 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/15419b85ab3f28f00212f4a8b10892a1.webm?t=1782279052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/15419b85ab3f28f00212f4a8b10892a1.mp4?t=1782279052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a vow with your beloved amidst the blessings of all the townspeople!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/ac2e2e7a04b006b15f617c28d7b675e6.avif?t=1782279052\" width=700 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/2c6db76c59810f0eb344dbe83adca62c.avif?t=1782279052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras_big/2c6db76c59810f0eb344dbe83adca62c.webp?t=1782279052 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/de675a6b15402815d40899314875eb2f.avif?t=1782279052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras_big/de675a6b15402815d40899314875eb2f.webp?t=1782279052 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/df92538eb3967f388d6c9e8508105597.avif?t=1782279052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras_big/df92538eb3967f388d6c9e8508105597.webp?t=1782279052 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/aff960034dff1b7e25a1f29461d2bc71.avif?t=1782279052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras_big/aff960034dff1b7e25a1f29461d2bc71.webp?t=1782279052 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/a0333b9357095cfad9d7064ccdcaa700.avif?t=1782279052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras_big/a0333b9357095cfad9d7064ccdcaa700.webp?t=1782279052 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/7489a2f28c365a3b9c7fbd50baa8511f.avif?t=1782279052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras_big/7489a2f28c365a3b9c7fbd50baa8511f.webp?t=1782279052 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/88c3055d85e7e886a37c1323bd17a87a.avif?t=1782279052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras_big/88c3055d85e7e886a37c1323bd17a87a.webp?t=1782279052 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/091e60bd1d119cddeb3f2ba0e7b31eec.avif?t=1782279052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras_big/091e60bd1d119cddeb3f2ba0e7b31eec.webp?t=1782279052 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/2ecbc784afdad570cc82826377b83217.avif?t=1782279052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras_big/2ecbc784afdad570cc82826377b83217.webp?t=1782279052 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/cdc52392ccf724cac1f30990a8d679a7.avif?t=1782279052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras_big/cdc52392ccf724cac1f30990a8d679a7.webp?t=1782279052 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/f48c5d9df3c3223ed040abc62cc4fda1.avif?t=1782279052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras_big/f48c5d9df3c3223ed040abc62cc4fda1.webp?t=1782279052 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/928ffad3a6918f165800ebf7566f1bfa.avif?t=1782279052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras_big/928ffad3a6918f165800ebf7566f1bfa.webp?t=1782279052 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/c585f57d0acbf031cd174e78bcb9b26f.avif?t=1782279052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras_big/c585f57d0acbf031cd174e78bcb9b26f.webp?t=1782279052 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/bd7015212f67e462bf274253efd8925a.avif?t=1782279052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras_big/bd7015212f67e462bf274253efd8925a.webp?t=1782279052 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/24613273bdd6150e81d7d768aef37780.avif?t=1782279052\" width=700 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Encountering vivid characters——</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of bonds will arise from meeting them? What kind of stories can we write together with them? What changes will your arrival bring to them? This will depend on your actions and choices!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Taste seeking Magic Continent——</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Padua and the royal city of Anglin face each other from afar across the Sea of Mirrors. People from all over the world come here every day, how can we satisfy the tastes of different customers? What strange dishes can be cooked using a variety of strange ingredients for harvesting?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Choose a leisurely lifestyle——</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to spend time outside of opening a store? Whether it's feeling the joy of harvesting fruits or experiencing the joy of catching a big fish; Whether it's brewing delicious wine or embarking on adventures and adventures Choose the way you like and enjoy life freely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Enhance partner goodwill——</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stable operation of the Witch's Tavern relies on the support and assistance of friends. Through interaction and communication, sincere emotions are born. However, can our relationship be closer? Friendship? love? Make a choice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Take a walk outside when you have free time——</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Staying in the store all day is too boring! Going out may encounter strange events and unexpected gains: travelers carrying pig tails, graves washed away by floods, basements as bright as daylight... Maybe you will also see a little-known side of your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Decorate personalized taverns——</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am in charge of my tavern! Is it warm or mischievous? Is it simple or gorgeous? Transform it as you please!</p>", "short_description": "Witches Tavern is a life simulation game that combines elements of inn management, role-playing, and romance development. As the new owner of the Witch Tavern, you will get to know various friends in the magical city of Venesia and embark on a fulfilling and exciting journey.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/a14951b50c42c4544d83365c7beac0ff5b29e579/header.jpg?t=1782279052", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/7f1918fdf7d6504ef28f05858f2f1529000a1129/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782279052", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/7f1918fdf7d6504ef28f05858f2f1529000a1129/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782279052", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> windows 7/10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 2.00 GHz 或 AMD A10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 